{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "2.1.9 and 2.5 are different protocols: a server answers the wrong one with silence, so a tunnel that never comes up is what a wrong choice here looks like.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.1.9 and 2.5 are different protocols: a server answers the wrong one with silence, so a tunnel that never comes up is what a wrong choice here looks like."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2.1.9 и 2.5 — разные протоколы: сервер отвечает на чужой молчанием, поэтому неверный выбор выглядит как туннель, который никак не поднимается."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "<1 minute": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "<1 minute"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "< 1 минуты"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A relay that stops taking bytes is restarted after a second instead of holding every connection's traffic until the liveness rule restarts it (35–60 s). Off: a write waits as long as the relay makes it (the behaviour before build 438).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A relay that stops taking bytes is restarted after a second instead of holding every connection's traffic until the liveness rule restarts it (35–60 s). Off: a write waits as long as the relay makes it (the behaviour before build 438)."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Релей, переставший принимать байты, перезапускается через секунду, а не держит трафик всех соединений до срабатывания правила живости (35–60 с). Выкл.: запись ждёт столько, сколько её держит релей (поведение до сборки 438)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add"
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавить"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a subscription URL to keep its servers in sync. One subscription uses one device for all of its servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a subscription URL to keep its servers in sync. One subscription uses one device for all of its servers."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавьте ссылку подписки, чтобы серверы обновлялись сами. Одна подписка использует одно устройство для всех своих серверов."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add at least one call link (one per line). Each adds 2 TURN relays (~20 connections); the first line is also anonymous mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add at least one call link (one per line). Each adds 2 TURN relays (~20 connections); the first line is also anonymous mode."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Добавьте хотя бы одну ссылку звонка (по одной в строке). Каждая добавляет 2 TURN-ретранслятора (~20 подключений); первая строка также используется в анонимном режиме."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add subscription": {
      "localizations": {
