    "csqtt 2.5 has no devices: the tunnel address belongs to the password, and one password serves one device at a time. Its keys come from a DTLS handshake with the server; if the server answers none, from the password alone — and then, as with 2.1.9, traffic recorded today can be decrypted by anyone who learns the password later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "csqtt 2.5 has no devices: the tunnel address belongs to the password, and one password serves one device at a time. Its keys come from a DTLS handshake with the server; if the server answers none, from the password alone — and then, as with 2.1.9, traffic recorded today can be decrypted by anyone who learns the password later."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "У csqtt 2.5 нет устройств: адрес туннеля принадлежит паролю, и один пароль обслуживает одно устройство одновременно. Ключи берутся из DTLS-рукопожатия с сервером; если сервер его не выполняет — из одного пароля, и тогда, как и в 2.1.9, записанный сегодня трафик сможет расшифровать любой, кто узнает пароль позже."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "csqtt has no key exchange: the password is the tunnel's only key, so traffic recorded today can be decrypted by anyone who learns it later (no forward secrecy). The other modes do not have this property.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "csqtt has no key exchange: the password is the tunnel's only key, so traffic recorded today can be decrypted by anyone who learns it later (no forward secrecy). The other modes do not have this property."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "В csqtt нет обмена ключами: пароль — единственный ключ туннеля, поэтому записанный сегодня трафик сможет расшифровать любой, кто узнает его позже (нет прямой секретности). У других режимов такого свойства нет."
          }
        }
      }
    },
